{"id":"c56721befebba903","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-directed-poset.md","title":"ZFC Directed Poset","display":"df-zfc-directed-poset — ZFC Directed Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-directed-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-directed-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-directed-poset — ZFC Directed Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-directed-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-directed-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-directed-poset — ZFC Directed Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (order relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S\\)</span>（兼容调用谓词，其参数和定义式见下文）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}directed\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P r\\land q\\leq_P r)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}directed\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P r\\land q\\leq_P r)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有向偏序首先必须是非空偏序；原式只给出了共同上界条件，对空集会真空成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}directed\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land P\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P r\\land q\\leq_P r)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P).","display":true}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"56a8ae5e0bd78f34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDirectedPoset}_S$ (directed-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-directed-poset]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1857","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-directed-poset.md|58-df-zfc-directed-poset]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}